  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.6.1.0 (2026-08-17): Removed support for Net9.0 (Out of support since 2026-05-12), added support for Net10.0, updated NuGet packages, removed the `failureCallback` option and the obsolete `System.Net.Http` reference, fixed the HTML escaping (A `<` arrived as the literal text `&lt;`), fixed the token order of the `outputTemplate` option, fixed the parameter name of the `ArgumentNullException` for a missing HTTP client, added offline tests.",
